[b]AC's Homebrew[/b]
More ways to build your commander in Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous.

AC's Homebrew adds selectable feats for attribute conversion, weapon styles, retaliation, summoning, spellcasting and other builds. It is an independent mod, separate from Homebrew Archetypes.

[b]Version 0.2.1 — Public beta[/b]
This update adds two combat-maneuver feats, fixes loading with the game's bundled Harmony library, and completes the rename to ACHomebrew. Balance is still being refined. When reporting a problem, please include the feat, your settings, game version and other installed mods.

[b]What you can build[/b]
[list]
[*]Attribute conversions: use different attributes for weapon attacks and damage, improve one attribute from another, or change the attribute used by a selected spellbook or resource.
[*]Combat maneuvers: Seize the Opening grants free-action maneuvers with per-round and encounter limits. Lingering Disruption doubles eligible timed effects, adding at least two rounds. Both have adjustable settings and support compatible mod-added maneuvers.
[*]Weapon styles: specialize in close, reach or ranged combat, with additional momentum, execution and retaliation options.
[*]Magic and summoning: explore spell-slot interactions, immunity piercing and summon-focused feats.
[*]Other approaches: stealth, solo play, survival and growth. A separate optional meme menu is disabled by default.
[/list]
At character creation or level-up, open [b]AC's Homebrew[/b], choose a feat family, then choose an individual feat. Menus do not consume extra feat choices.

[b]Choose your limits[/b]
Optional settings limit the number of Homebrew feats, their total point cost, or both. These limits are off by default. Exclusion groups have a master switch and individual controls. Lowering a limit does not remove existing feats; characters above it cannot choose more until they are within the limit again.

[b]Installation[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Install Unity Mod Manager for Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous.
[*]Download ACHomebrew-0.2.1.zip and install it through Unity Mod Manager's Mods tab.
[*]Enable AC's Homebrew and review its settings in the UMM window.
[/list]
Game assemblies used for development and offline validation: WotR 2.7.0. No other content mod is required. BlueprintCore is bundled. ModMenu is optional and adds the settings to the game's options screen; ModTagEx is optional and labels this mod's content.

[b]Updating from AttributeFeats / WotR Homebrew[/b]
The UMM Id, assembly and installation folder now use [b]ACHomebrew[/b] ([b]ACHomebrew.dll[/b], [b]Mods/ACHomebrew[/b]). Disable the old AttributeFeats entry in UMM before installing this version, then restart the game. Keep the old Settings.xml until your settings have been imported; the new installation reads it automatically if it has no settings of its own. Existing blueprint identifiers are preserved. Do not enable both installations together.

Several effects have changed. The six broad Main Attribute feats are retired from selection and have narrower effects on existing characters. New Main Attribute Mastery feats improve one chosen target attribute. Aptitudes, some stances and summoning effects were narrowed; distance styles were rebuilt. Existing characters receive the revised effects. Back up your saves before updating, and use respec if you want to replace retired choices.

[b]Languages and known limits[/b]
Editable language files are included under Localization/. English and Simplified Chinese have been reviewed; German, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese and Russian translations still need community review. Some UMM setting labels remain English. The spellbook header can still show its original casting attribute. A changed resource attribute updates maximum uses when the resource is next restored. Six Weapon Damage feats do not yet have bespoke icons. Individual feat interactions, save/respec behavior and compatibility with large modlists still need further game testing.

[b]中文简介[/b]
AC 的房规手册提供属性转换、武器流派、反击、召唤、施法等可单独选择的专长，并允许配置总数量、点数额度和互斥组。它是独立模组，与 Homebrew Archetypes 不是同一个项目。0.2.1 新增“乘隙制敌”和“余势未消”两项战技专长，并修复游戏自带 Harmony 的加载兼容问题。旧版玩家请先在 UMM 中禁用 AttributeFeats，再安装新版并重启游戏。新安装目录为 Mods/ACHomebrew；请先保留旧 Settings.xml，新版会在没有自身设置时自动读取。

